---
---
<section id="gaya" aria-labelledby="judul-gaya" class="wash-proses border-t border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <h2 id="judul-gaya" class="reveal font-display max-w-[18ch] text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">
        Ruang terang dengan material yang terasa hangat.
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal max-w-[36ch] text-[15px] leading-7 text-muted-ink">Tiga contoh suasana ruang. Semuanya ilustrasi, bukan foto proyek.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Momen material: satu detail besar yang hangat -->
    <!-- illustration-palette: intentional literal — see note above, tokens in global.css + DESIGN.md -->
    <figure class="reveal mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card shadow-[0_32px_64px_-32px_rgba(28,25,23,0.35)]">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" class="block h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="material-title material-desc">
        <title id="material-title">Detail material contoh: serat kayu, tenun linen, cahaya pagi</title>
        <desc id="material-desc">Sudut ruang terang dengan meja kayu berserat, bantal linen bertenun, dan sorotan cahaya pagi dari jendela.</desc>
        <defs>
          <pattern id="tenun" width="10" height="10" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <rect width="10" height="10" fill="#f4efe8" />
            <path d="M0 2.5h10M0 7.5h10M2.5 0v10M7.5 0v10" stroke="#d6cdbf" stroke-width="1" />
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="600" height="200" fill="#f3ebe1" />
        <rect y="200" width="600" height="100" fill="#d9b98f" />
        <g stroke="#b68f5e" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.75" fill="none">
          <path d="M0 222c60-6 120 6 180 0s120-6 180 0 120 6 240 0" />
          <path d="M0 244c60-5 120 5 180 0s120-5 180 0 120 5 240 0" />
          <path d="M0 266c60-5 120 5 180 0s120-5 180 0 120 5 240 0" />
          <path d="M40 214c8 12 6 24 0 34M180 214c-6 12-4 24 2 34M420 214c8 12 6 24 0 34" opacity="0.6" />
        </g>
        <rect x="36" y="28" width="110" height="172" rx="6" fill="#fffdfb" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2.5" />
        <path d="M91 28v172M36 114h110" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="1.8" />
        <path d="M146 44 360 200 146 200Z" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.55" />
        <path d="M146 44 360 200" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5" />
        <rect x="180" y="150" width="260" height="52" rx="10" fill="#fffdfb" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2.5" />
        <g stroke="#8a6a3e" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.8" fill="none">
          <path d="M196 166c30-5 60 5 90 0s60-5 90 0 30 4 54 0" />
          <path d="M196 178c30-4 60 4 90 0s60-4 90 0 30 3 54 0" />
          <path d="M196 190c40-3 80 3 120 0s80-3 104 0" />
        </g>
        <path d="M200 202v22m220-22v22" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2.5" />
        <rect x="196" y="108" width="150" height="56" rx="12" fill="url(#tenun)" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2" />
        <rect x="356" y="118" width="96" height="46" rx="10" fill="#fbe7d6" stroke="#9a3f1f" stroke-width="2" />
        <path d="M368 130h72M368 138h48" stroke="#eabd97" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <path d="M470 0v52" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2" />
        <path d="M444 52h52l10 28H434Z" fill="#f7e8d3" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="2" />
        <ellipse cx="470" cy="88" rx="30" ry="8" fill="#92400e" opacity="0.18" />
        <path d="M500 150c-2-16 6-24 0-38m0 38c10-3 16-10 18-20" stroke="#3d4837" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
      <figcaption class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-line px-5 py-4 sm:px-7">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="h-7 w-7 rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-oak"></span>
          <span class="h-7 w-7 rounded-md border border-line bg-kapur"></span>
          <span class="h-7 w-7 rounded-md border border-gold-line bg-gold-soft"></span>
          <span class="ml-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-muted-ink">serat oak · tenun linen · cahaya pagi</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-ink">Detail sudut ruang tamu · <span class="font-semibold tracking-wide">ILUSTRASI · CONTOH</span></span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <figure class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 300 200" class="block h-auto w-full" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="300" height="132" fill="#f0f2e9" /><rect y="132" width="300" height="68" fill="#e9e2d8" />
          <path d="M0 150h300M0 170h300" stroke="#c8cfb8" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" />
          <ellipse cx="150" cy="162" rx="104" ry="10" fill="#1c1917" opacity="0.07" />
          <rect x="50" y="90" width="200" height="50" rx="10" fill="#fffdfb" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2" />
          <rect x="50" y="66" width="200" height="28" rx="8" fill="#e8ebe0" stroke="#4f5d46" stroke-width="2" />
          <circle cx="150" cy="34" r="11" fill="#f7e8d3" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.8" />
          <path d="M150 23V10" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="1.8" />
        </svg>
        <figcaption class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="font-semibold">Kamar</span><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-muted-ink">ILUSTRASI</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card" style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 300 200" class="block h-auto w-full" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="300" height="132" fill="#faf5f2" /><rect y="132" width="300" height="68" fill="#d9b98f" />
          <g stroke="#b68f5e" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.6"><path d="M0 152h300M0 172h300M0 190h300" /></g>
          <ellipse cx="150" cy="160" rx="110" ry="9" fill="#1c1917" opacity="0.07" />
          <rect x="30" y="50" width="240" height="80" rx="8" fill="#fffdfb" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2" />
          <path d="M30 84h240" stroke="#e7e0d9" stroke-width="2" />
          <rect x="48" y="96" width="52" height="20" rx="4" fill="#f4efe8" stroke="#d6cdbf" stroke-width="1.4" />
          <rect x="190" y="100" width="60" height="16" rx="4" fill="#f7e8d3" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.6" />
        </svg>
        <figcaption class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="font-semibold">Dapur</span><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-muted-ink">ILUSTRASI</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 sm:p-7">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-soft">CATATAN DENAH · ILUSTRASI</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-muted-ink">bukan foto sebelum–sesudah, melainkan cara kami mencatat perubahan</p>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 560 140" class="mt-4 h-auto w-full" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="8" y="12" width="300" height="116" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="2" />
        <path d="M8 60h300M140 12v116" stroke="#e7e0d9" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <rect x="24" y="72" width="90" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f4efe8" stroke="#4f5d46" stroke-width="1.8" />
        <rect x="160" y="72" width="110" height="36" rx="6" fill="#fbf1e2" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.8" />
        <circle cx="340" cy="70" r="4" fill="#1c1917" />
        <path d="M348 70h40" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <rect x="396" y="28" width="156" height="84" rx="8" fill="#faf5f2" stroke="#d6cdbf" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <path d="M412 52h124M412 66h88M412 80h104" stroke="#d6cdbf" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <path d="M412 96h60" stroke="#4f5d46" stroke-width="1.8" />
      </svg>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-ink sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li>Sofa digeser ke sisi cahaya pagi</li>
        <li>Rak tinggi, bukan lemari baru</li>
        <li>Tiap barang ada tempat + catatan rawat</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
